<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίτιμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, of
		a citizen, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in possession of his
				rights and franchises</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμαί</span>),
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτιμος</span> (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				702
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.2.11
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρήματα ἐ.</span> property
				<i>not confiscated,</i> though the owner was in exile,
				Lexap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				23.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>valuable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				1.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>subject to penalty</i>: hence, <i>contraband,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαϊκόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					39.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίτιμον, τό,</span>=
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτίμιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				685.81
			</span></i>(pl., Crete, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				43.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Test.Epict.</u>
				6.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGen.</u>
				1.20.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, etc.</div>
